 'Campaign A 訂單與營收成長，但近期單位經濟正在惡化。':'Campaign A is growing volume while its near-term unit economics deteriorate.','主力 SKU 的需求加速，可能在補貨前售罄。':'Accelerating demand could exhaust a revenue-critical SKU before replenishment.','整體回購下降主要是 cohort 組合效應。':'Aggregate repeat decline is mostly a cohort-mix effect, not clear customer abandonment.','自然流量效率改善，但規模可能仍受限制。':'Organic efficiency is improving, though its scale may remain constrained.','成本壓力集中在牛肉丼；高級牛肉套餐仍具吸引力。':'Food-cost pressure is concentrated in Beef Bowl, while premium mix remains economically attractive.','促銷量增加，但更深的折扣稀釋了貢獻。':'Promotion volume increased, but deeper discounts diluted contribution.','回購下降與配送表現惡化較一致。':'Repeat decline aligns more with worsening delivery performance than food ratings.','高級套餐顯示的是菜單組合改善機會。':'Premium bundles suggest a menu-mix opportunity, not simply a cost problem.','整體完成度接近計畫，但關鍵路徑工作已經脆弱。':'Completion is near plan, but critical-path work is now fragile.','近期範圍增加正用盡剩餘交付彈性。':'Recent scope additions are consuming almost all remaining delivery flexibility.','輕微供應商延遲已超過相依 Slack。':'A modest vendor delay exceeds dependency slack and threatens UAT preparation.','非關鍵工作流可能有暫時產能，可保護關鍵工作。':'Non-critical workstreams may provide temporary capacity to protect path-critical work.',
 '成長不等於健康的經濟效益。Campaign A 的營收和訂單增加，同時折扣、CAC 與每筆運費補貼上升，導致貢獻率顯著下降。':'Growth does not automatically mean healthy economics. Campaign A revenue and orders rose, but deeper discounts, higher CAC, and shipping costs reduced contribution margin sharply.','需求加速、4.2 天可售天數、11 天交期與 14% 營收曝險同時出現，已具管理意義。':'Low inventory alone is not enough to determine urgency. Here, accelerated demand, 4.2 days of cover, an 11-day lead time, and 14% revenue exposure make the risk management-relevant.','整體回購率下滑主要來自尚未進入相同回購窗口的新客占比提高；成熟 cohort 相對穩定。':'The decline in overall repeat rate is driven primarily by a larger share of recently acquired customers who have not entered the same repeat window, while mature cohorts remain relatively stable.','自然獲客經濟正在改善，但流量成長明顯低於付費通路；效率與可擴張性需要分開評估。':'Organic acquisition economics are improving, but traffic growth remains much lower than paid-channel growth, so efficiency and scalability should be evaluated separately.','高食材成本率不必然等於低獲利。牛肉丼成本率高、單筆貢獻低；高級牛肉套餐成本率更高，單筆貢獻卻更強。':'High food-cost percentage does not automatically mean low profitability. Beef Bowl has high food cost and low contribution per order; Premium Beef Set has the highest ratio yet the strongest contribution.','更多促銷訂單不必然代表促銷更有效；訂單量增加不足以抵銷促銷單筆貢獻下降。':'More promotion-driven orders do not automatically mean better promotion performance. The volume increase is not offsetting lower contribution per promoted order.','回購下降與配送時間變差的同時性，高於與餐點評分的變化；餐點評分仍相對穩定。':'Repeat-order decline coincides more strongly with worsening delivery performance than with food ratings, which remain relatively stable.','高級套餐同時具備較高單筆貢獻與較佳回購表現，代表可優先探索菜單組合，而不只是削減食材成本。':'Premium bundles combine higher contribution per order with stronger repeat behavior, suggesting an opportunity to improve menu mix rather than simply reduce food cost.','高完成度不等於低交付風險。API Integration 與 UAT Preparation 幾乎沒有 Slack，缺陷與重工也同步增加。':'High completion does not automatically mean low delivery risk. API Integration and UAT Preparation carry little to no slack, while defects and rework have increased.','有商業價值的功能不必然適合現在加入；UAT 前，新增範圍正在吃掉僅存排程彈性。':'A valuable feature is not automatically safe to add now. Recent additions are consuming remaining delivery flexibility as UAT approaches.','當相依 Slack 小於延遲時，小幅供應商延遲也可能被放大為專案影響。':'A small vendor delay can create a larger project impact when dependency slack is smaller than the delay.','資源使用率需與相依與 Slack 一起解讀；非關鍵工作流仍有可暫時調度的容量。':'Resource utilization should be interpreted together with dependency and schedule slack. Some non-critical workstreams retain capacity that may be temporarily reassigned.',
 'Campaign A 的成長正在帶來較弱的短期貢獻經濟。':'Campaign A growth is creating weaker near-term contribution economics.','現有庫存可能無法支撐至下一個補貨窗口。':'Current inventory is unlikely to cover demand until the next replenishment window.','整體回購下滑高估既有客戶行為惡化程度。':'Aggregate retention decline overstates deterioration in existing-customer behavior.','自然流量更有效率，但未必能承接廣泛成長目標。':'Organic is becoming more efficient, but may not absorb broad growth expectations.','牛肉丼成本壓力正在侵蝕貢獻；高級套餐不支持一概削減成本。':'Beef Bowl cost pressure is reducing contribution, while Premium Beef Set economics qualify a blanket cost-cutting response.','促銷量的成長快於促銷經濟品質。':'Promotion volume is growing faster than its economic quality.','配送表現是比餐點品質惡化更強的解釋。':'Delivery performance is a stronger interpretation than food-quality deterioration.','高級套餐單筆貢獻與回購表現均優於菜單平均。':'Premium bundles are outperforming the average menu on contribution and repeat behavior.','即使整體完成度健康，關鍵路徑壓力仍造成重大交付風險。':'Critical-path pressure creates material delivery risk despite apparently healthy overall completion.','目前範圍接受模式增加 UAT 前時程風險。':'The current scope-acceptance pattern increases timing risk ahead of UAT.','供應商預估延遲超過可用 Slack，威脅下游 UAT 準備。':'The vendor forecast delay exceeds available slack and threatens downstream UAT preparation.','在清楚護欄下，非關鍵工作流可能提供可回收產能。':'With clear guardrails, non-critical workstreams may provide recoverable capacity to protect the critical path.',
